      <b>Delete customer</b>
    </h2>`, plain=`Delete customer`, deco=Full) {
        simple(1.1, 5d2a9f01, `If the user wants to delete the customer, they press the button <b>Delete</b>.`, plain=`If the user wants to delete the customer, they press the button Delete.`);
